SUMMARY:CityFair Opening Night Fireworks
DESCRIPTION:Experience Magic Live\, Portland! Enjoy live music\, local vendors\, delicious food & drink\, as well as an amazing fireworks display! Set against the vibrant backdrop of the city at the historic Tom McCall Waterfront Park\, join the fun across three full weekends beginning on May 22nd through June 7th. \nKids age 6 and under enter FREE at the gate. \nMilitary and Veterans enter FREE at the gate. \nEditor’s note: This event is a community submission.
