SUMMARY:Pasifika & Asian American Community Science Night at OMSI
DESCRIPTION:Join community members and OMSI for the fourth-annual Pasifika and Asian American Community Science Night. This event welcomes visitors of all ages for a night of museum exploring\, science demonstrations\, vendor tables\, and cultural entertainment – all in celebration of the local Pasifika and Asian American community. All are welcome! \n\nTickets\nGeneral Admission \n$10 Adults\, $8 Seniors\, $8 Youth | OMSI members receive a 15% discount\nIncludes access to OMSI’s permanent exhibits including the Turbine Hall and the Natural Science Hall\, plus special activities\, performances\, planetarium shows\, lectures\, and vendors taking part in the event.
URL:https://pdxparent.com/event-single/pasifika-asian-american-community-science-night-at-omsi/
LOCATION:OMSI
CATEGORIES:Active,Educational,Indoor,Kids Calendar,Museum,STEM
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://pdxparent.com/wp-content/uploads/Pasifika-and-Asian-American-Community-Science-Night.jpg
