SUMMARY:Once Upon a Mattress
DESCRIPTION:In this fairy tale musical\, no one in the kingdom can marry until the prince does. Will the delightful and unconventional Princess Winnifred the Woebegone win over the prince (and his mother) and find a place she truly belongs? Suitable for most theater goers. Run time is approximately 2 hours and 15 minutes\, including one 15 minute intermission. \nMay 21 to June 21. Thursday to Sunday: 7:30 pm; Saturday and Sunday: additional 2 pm shows.
URL:https://pdxparent.com/event-single/once-upon-a-mattress/2026-05-22/
LOCATION:Broadway Rose Theatre\, 12850 SW Grant Ave.\, Tigard\, Oregon
CATEGORIES:Indoor,Kids Calendar,Theater
