SUMMARY:Opening Weekend & Storytime at Hoffman Farms
DESCRIPTION:Enjoy a fun-filled morning on the farm with stories\, fresh air\, and all the excitement of opening weekend at Hoffman Farms. Between strawberry milkshakes\, train rides\, the playground\, fresh baked treats\, and storytime\, you don’t want to miss opening weekend! Storytime is at 10am. Keep an eye on their website and social media for strawberry u-pick updates!
