SUMMARY:Wildflowers & Watersheds Festival
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate the beauty and importance of our region’s ecosystems at the Wildflowers & Watersheds Festival! Enjoy guided wildflower walks\, relax with a rejuvenating yoga session\, and connect with local organizations offering engaging booths and activities for all ages. Fuel up at the Basalt Rock Cafe with a delicious lunch! \nFREE admission all day! No registration required. \nSCHEDULE HIGHLIGHTS \n9:00 AM: Nature Yoga & Meditation at the Pond with Wild Bloom Yoga\n11:00 AM: Festival Begins\n2:00 PM: Gorge-Themed Tunes in the River Gallery with Trails & Tunes\n3:00 PM: Festival Concludes \n11:00-3:00: Hands-on activities\, wildflower walks\, booths\, solar scopes\, stream tables & more! \nEditor’s note: This event is a community submission.
URL:https://pdxparent.com/event-single/wildflowers-watersheds-festival/
LOCATION:Columbia Gorge Discovery Center and Museum
CATEGORIES:Arts/Crafts,Educational,Family Fun,Indoor,Kids Calendar,Museum,Outdoor,Plants & Nature,STEM
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://pdxparent.com/wp-content/uploads/Instagram-Schedule.jpg
END:VEVENT
