SUMMARY:62th Annual Gem And Mineral Show
DESCRIPTION:Delight your little rock hound at the 62th annual gem and mineral show in Canby! There will be activities for kids\, demonstrations for adults\, silent auction\, bargain rock sale and of course various dealer booths. Free admission and parking. \nThe event includes: \n\nKids’ Corner\n\nDoor Prizes \n\n\nDisplay Cases \n\n\nFluorescent Show \n\n\nSilent Auction \n\n\nDealers \n\n\nSlabs\, Bargain Rocks \n\n\nDemonstrations \n\n\nGuess the weight rock \n\n\nSnack Bar \n\n\nAs well as numerous dealers\, vendors and much more.
URL:https://pdxparent.com/event-single/62th-annual-gem-and-mineral-show/2026-05-23/
